###Text
Text test::coralvineyard4::text::NetworkOverview
{
  type: markdown;
  content: '# High route refuge network\n\nRefuges, their dormitories and the bunks inside them arrive as nested JSON submissions from each hut. A model-to-model mapping reshapes them into the published refuge directory, normalising codes and massif names and grading every bunk by its length.\n\nKeepers and trail stages arrive as separate feeds with their own mappings, and an archive runtime serves past stages on their own.\n';
}

Text test::coralvineyard4::text::SiteRules
{
  type: markdown;
  content: '# Site rules\n\nEvery site must be named, must declare its massif, must carry a surveyed altitude and must be reachable by phone or by at least one radio channel. The checked refuge fetch reports each broken rule beside the value it still produced.\n';
}
